Irregular triangle read by rows: row n consists of the coefficients of the expansion of the polynomial (x + 1)^n + x^2 - 1.

The 73 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

